  "details": "See the attached image. This screen is MM > Social > filter icon > Filter Groups settings.\n\nThere are two strings on Crowdin.\n\n- 23631 `Group Public`\n\n- 23553 `Groups Public`\n\nYou should replace 23553 with 23631, and delete 23553.\n\nAlso, 23631 has an unresolved issue on the Crowdin comment. Please resolve it, too.\n\nIn the case of Groups Plus:\n\n- 23555 `Groups Plus`\n\n- 98880 `Group Plus`\n\n- 35018 `Group+`\n\nAnd there is an \"available in future release\" post https://feedback.vrchat.com/localization/p/replace-group-plus-strings-with-group\n\nSo, You should replace all usage of 23555 and 98880 with 35018. And delete 23555 and 98880.",
